# IDE / editor
# JetBrains (Android Studio, IntelliJ, ...) — per-machine project metadata, never shared.
# This repo has no IDE-managed build, so none of it is worth committing.
.idea/
.vs/
.vscode/
*.iml

# OS
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# Deliberately NOT ignored — these are the product, not local noise:
#   .loop/       the standalone distributable (tracked on purpose)
#   .ai/         a consumer repo's execution state. If this repo is ever itself run through
#                the loop, the engine MUST be able to commit .ai/ as part of its atomic
#                checkpoint (ENGINE.md §6.9) — ignoring it here would silently break the loop.
#   PRD.md       same reason: human-owned intent, committed at bootstrap.
#   knowledge/   durable, cumulative, meant to survive every run.
